00:00:30.342 --> 00:00:33.016
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:33.016 --> 00:00:34.117
- [Bianca] Hello.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:34.950
- [Cody] Hello everybody.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:35.940
- [Kelly] What's up y'all?

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.050
Well, Bianca, I'm gonna start with you.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.160
It's good to see you.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.270
And last time we spoke,

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.490
you were about to make
history at WrestleMania 37.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.440
So what's in store this year?

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.420
- You know, the last time
I saw you, WrestleMania 37

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.104
I got to the Main Event at WrestleMania,

00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:48.690
