SmackDown Women's Champion.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:51.690
So I'm very excited about
WrestleMania 39 this year in LA.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.760
I'll be facing Asuka and defending

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.230
my Raw Women's Championship.

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.104
So I'm hoping to walk out still

00:00:57.104 --> 00:00:59.790
