00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:11.610
I was hanging around for a few months,

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:13.603
having some great matches, and then I,

00:01:13.603 --> 00:01:17.130
I tore this pec tendon
totally off the bone.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:18.690
It was down in here.

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:22.230
They tied it back on over
here, said nine months.

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:23.910
I was able to come back in seven

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:25.530
and win the Royal Rumble,

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:27.930
punch my ticket to WrestleMania.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:29.640
Get the opportunity to
wrestle Roman Reigns,

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.860
our undisputed champion
to win a championship

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.650
I've never touched, nor
anybody in my family,

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:35.483
has ever touched.

00:01:35.483 --> 00:01:37.860
So this is uh, this is the big one.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.950
- Oh I love it. Man,
congratulations on healing well,

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:41.783
by the way.

00:01:41.783 --> 00:01:43.660
You're like I did it in seven.
(chuckling and snapping)

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:45.260
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.580
Like, um so Bianca, after WrestleMania,

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.320
you have another big project coming up

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:50.940
so tell us what it is.

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:51.958
