00:01:51.958 --> 00:01:54.090
My husband and I are actually getting

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:56.249
a reality series on Hulu.

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:58.260
We're very excited about it.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.180
We're gonna pull the
curtain back a little bit.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:02.670
Everyone gets to see
who we are in the ring.

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:04.110
And so we're really just
gonna show, you know

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:05.940
