00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.650
with our family and
pull the curtain behind

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:09.960
and kind of get to see who
we are outside the ring.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.000
And we're just, we're just
excited to share that part

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.020
of our life with everyone.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:15.600
So make sure everybody
watches and, and tune into it.

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:16.433
We need the ratings.

00:02:16.433 --> 00:02:17.780
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:18.613
- [Kelly] I'm so excited for y'all.

00:02:18.613 --> 00:02:20.209
Congratulations on that.

00:02:20.209 --> 00:02:21.042
(Kelly clapping)

00:02:21.042 --> 00:02:22.140
Remember everybody this weekend,

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:25.080
