00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:30.210
You can catch all the action
exclusively on Peacock.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:31.560
Thank you so much, Bianca.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.436
Thank you Cody, for joining us.

00:02:33.436 --> 00:02:34.269
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:02:34.269 --> 00:02:36.225
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:36.225 --> 00:02:37.058
